                                                                                                                "rows": 3,
                                                                                                                "type": "textarea",
                                                                                                                "value": "Seven-year appointment, consistently our strongest Midwest transportation producer. 214 submissions YTD with a 31.4% hit ratio — above the 26% zone average — and book loss ratio at 52.1% puts them inside the contingent commission threshold. Submission quality is high: SOVs and loss runs arrive complete, which is why average turnaround sits at 4.8 days against a 7-day target. No binding authority and none requested. Candidate for Platinum tier at the January 2027 review if GWP clears $22M.",
